        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, keyboard, standard version, to WEEE treatment</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, keyboard, standard version, to WEEE treatment
process of the mechanical treatment (in a shredder) of an average composition of IT accessoires (i.e. keyboard, mouse, power adapter, …). Update 2023: the updated dataset now reflects the mass of power adaptor, keyboard, and mouse in the new datasets, which are the aggregation of all input materials described in the other section; Geography: data of the situation in Switzerland; UUID: df0aabd4-62bd-4f41-9ad0-7b628573bc65
This dataset represents the disposal way for WEEE device acessoires in Switzerland.
Location: data of the situation in Switzerland
Technology: current mechanical treatment of a IT accessoires mixture in Switzerland
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 82.5 kt total WEEE
Sampling: statistical data
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_df0aabd4-62bd-4f41-9ad0-7b628573bc65.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
